{%- comment -%}
  Promo blocks where Grid placement "Show after product number" matches this card index.
  @param grid_card_position {Number} Running count: each product card or variant card adds one.
  @param product_offset {Number} paginate.current_offset — products skipped before this page.

  Shopify caps collections[handle].products at 50, so the cards_before loop in the section cannot
  count earlier products once current_offset > 50. That makes grid_card_position restart too low on
  later pages and re-fires promos (e.g. "after 2"). Each product contributes at least one card, so
  if order_after <= product_offset, that slot already appeared on a previous page — skip.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign promo_product_offset = product_offset | default: 0
-%}
{%- for block in section.blocks -%}
  {%- if block.type == 'we_promo' and block.settings.order_after == grid_card_position -%}
    {%- if block.settings.order_after > promo_product_offset -%}
      {%- render 'we-collection-promo', block: block, image_sizes: image_sizes -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
